highway
------------------------------------------
Performance-portable, length-agnostic SIMD with runtime dispatch

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libhwy-devel-1.4.0-1bl2
  libhwy1-1.4.0-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/google/highway

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/google/highway/archive/refs/tags/1.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack highway-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./highway-1.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/highway-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/highway-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhwy1-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhwy-devel-1.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

